  ('d29170a6-b507-5a0d-abeb-bdf01882733d'::uuid, 3, 3, 15, 50, 5,
   $ex${"titre":"Corriger un paragraphe","competence":"argumenter","situation":"Un élève a rédigé un paragraphe de synthèse, avec des défauts. Repère-les, puis choisis les bons connecteurs.","documents":[{"id":"eleve","type":"texte","genre":"source","titre":"Un paragraphe d’élève","blocs":["1. In document A, the poet says that the sea is cold.","2. In document B, the writer says that the harbour is crowded.","3. Yet document C, unlike the poem, presents the newcomers as useful workers.","4. I think we should welcome everybody, because I like travelling."],"source":"Paragraphe imaginé pour l’exercice"},{"id":"conn","type":"tableau","titre":"Connectors","colonnes":["Function","Connectors"],"lignes":[["Add","moreover, furthermore"],["Oppose","whereas, while, however"],["Concede","although, admittedly"],["Conclude","therefore, thus"]],"enteteLignes":false,"source":"D’après le cours"}],"questions":[{"enonce":"Range chaque phrase de l’élève selon ce qu’elle fait.","aide":"Une phrase relie deux documents, une donne une opinion sans lien avec le dossier.","type":"categories","categories":[{"id":"c0","texte":"Un document commenté seul"},{"id":"c1","texte":"Deux documents mis en relation"},{"id":"c2","texte":"Un avis personnel hors sujet"}],"items":[{"id":"i0","texte":"I think we should welcome everybody, because I like travelling."},{"id":"i1","texte":"Yet document C, unlike the poem, presents the newcomers as useful workers."},{"id":"i2","texte":"In document B, the writer says that the harbour is crowded."},{"id":"i3","texte":"In document A, the poet says that the sea is cold."}]},{"enonce":"Touche le connecteur qui amorce la mise en relation.","aide":"Il ouvre la phrase 3.","type":"zone","document":"eleve","multiple":false},{"enonce":"Quel conseil donner pour améliorer les phrases 1 et 2 ?","aide":"Une synthèse croise les documents.","type":"choix","options":[{"id":"a","texte":"Y ajouter une longue citation du poème pour les allonger"},{"id":"b","texte":"Les recopier deux 