left-hand side; a small worker is in the background on the right."},{"id":"c","texte":"In the background, a worker stands on the right-hand side; the sun is in the bottom left-hand corner."},{"id":"d","texte":"The caption is at the top of the poster, above the sun, which is in the foreground."}],"multiple":false}]}$ex$::jsonb,
